<title>POLAND: SLASKI APRIL NET FALLS TO PLN 18.16 MLN.</title>
<headline>SLASKI APRIL NET FALLS TO PLN 18.16 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL						 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					 18.16 vs   25.86</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   28.04 vs   41.57</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 75.32 vs   73.05</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     123.52 vs  116.85</p>
<p> JANUARY-APRIL				     1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					 65.64 vs  129.20</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				  112.57 vs  187.20</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		299.92 vs  297.76</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     483.02 vs  458.87</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Slaski SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
